    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slingshot Quest</strong> is an RPG with turn-based combat, set in a fantasy world where a war between species wages on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save The World. Slay The Dragon.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Charlie</strong>, a Slingshot-user unsatisfied with his role as a healer. Your short trip to rescue your bird companion quickly turns into an ambitious quest to save the world, together with a rag-tag team of fellow fighters you meet along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Unlikely Friends. Strengthen Your Bonds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a close bond with four quirky allies, transcending the conflicts between species to work towards a common goal. Manage your party's stats and equipment, levelling them up after each thrilling fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Dangerous Dungeons. Push Beyond Your Limits.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working your way up from barely surviving in an abandoned, small fortress to conquering the lairs of the <strong>Void Dragon</strong> Itself, you'll see yourself growing stronger and more capable with every battle won.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master The Combat. Master the Slingshot.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slingshot Quest uses a <strong>turn-based</strong> battle system, inspired by classic JRPGs. On your turn, you can choose to cast a spell, attack an enemy, use an item, defend, unleash a powerful SUPER move, or attempt to escape. Combat features a <strong>quick-time</strong> event minigame for attacks. When using spells or items, you'll need to carefully <strong>aim</strong> to hit as many targets at once and deal as much damage as possible.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slingshot Quest</strong> is an RPG with turn-based combat, set in a fantasy world where a war between species wages on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save The World. Slay The Dragon.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Charlie</strong>, a Slingshot-user unsatisfied with his role as a healer. Your short trip to rescue your bird companion quickly turns into an ambitious quest to save the world, together with a rag-tag team of fellow fighters you meet along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Unlikely Friends. Strengthen Your Bonds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a close bond with four quirky allies, transcending the conflicts between species to work towards a common goal. Manage your party's stats and equipment, levelling them up after each thrilling fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Dangerous Dungeons. Push Beyond Your Limits.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working your way up from barely surviving in an abandoned, small fortress to conquering the lairs of the <strong>Void Dragon</strong> Itself, you'll see yourself growing stronger and more capable with every battle won.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master The Combat. Master the Slingshot.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slingshot Quest uses a <strong>turn-based</strong> battle system, inspired by classic JRPGs. On your turn, you can choose to cast a spell, attack an enemy, use an item, defend, unleash a powerful SUPER move, or attempt to escape. Combat features a <strong>quick-time</strong> event minigame for attacks. When using spells or items, you'll need to carefully <strong>aim</strong> to hit as many targets at once and deal as much damage as possible.</p>",
